nt with 4 unique abilities, apply different combinations, and solve your way to the exit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shells and unlock cute accessories to make your adventures more enjoyable!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedrun and replay levels to achieve high scores!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>You </i>are in control of your <i>hue</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Showcased at SXSW Sydney Student Games Showcase 2025!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106730/extras/fbc6fb7490836e2fd3af097430151285.avif?t=1763730251\" width=1560 height=619 /></span></p>",
